I ran the busfactor script with `--dry-run --no-github`, so nothing was written to the repo. Its output only contained a repo-wide fallback rule, `* ravi.menon@… alex.rowe@…`, and no per-file rules for these three areas. The per-file picture below comes from `git log`.

